{"id": "27167", "title": "骆驼祥子", "author": "老舍", "category": "文学名著", "count": 24, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/27/27167.htm", "intro": "《骆驼祥子》是老舍的代表作之一，主要是以北平（今北京）一个人力车夫祥子的行踪为线索，以二十年代末期的北京市民生活为背景，以洋车夫祥子的坎坷、悲惨的生活遭遇为主要情节，深刻揭露了旧中国的黑暗，控诉了统治阶级对劳动者的剥削、压迫，表达了作者对劳动人民的深切同情，向人们展示军阀混战、黑暗统治下的北京底层贫苦市民生活于痛苦深渊中的图景。", "base": "files/article/html/27/27167", "chapters": [{"title": "一", "file": "1834886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "1834887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "1834888.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "1834889.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "1834890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "1834891.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "1834892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "1834893.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "1834894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十", "file": "1834895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一", "file": "1834896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二", "file": "1834897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三", "file": "1834898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四", "file": "1834899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五", "file": "1834900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十六", "file": "1834901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十七", "file": "1834902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十八", "file": "1834903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十九", "file": "1834904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十", "file": "1834905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十一", "file": "1834906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十二", "file": "1834907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十三", "file": "1834908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十四", "file": "1834909.html", "available": false}]}